---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Статьи
description: Инструкции к инструментам, сначала новые.
lang: ru
section: articles
permalink: /ru/articles/
translationUrl: /articles/
englishUrl: /articles/
---
<article class="prose">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Статьи</p>
    <h1>Инструкции</h1>
  </header>
</article>

<section class="index-section" aria-label="Статьи">
  <ul class="index-list">
    {% for article in collections.articlesRu | reverse %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a>
        <span class="status">{{ article.date | isoDate }}</span>
        <p class="description">{{ article.data.description }}</p>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
